// importEthicsFacilitatorScripts.js
// Fills the host-only `script` (teleprompter) field on each agenda segment of the
// live Ethics Table Talk cohort sessions, from the GA Ethics facilitator guide.
//
// Content was extracted VERBATIM from GA-Ethics-COMPLETE-Facilitator-Guide.md
// (markup stripped to plain read-aloud text; no words changed) and is embedded
// below, keyed by segment ORDER within each half. A segment is written ONLY when
// its stored title also matches the expected title (normalized) — so if the live
// agenda titles ever drifted, nothing is mis-assigned; the segment is skipped and
// flagged instead.
//
// Targets ONLY: sessionType 'live-course', status 'scheduled', slug matching
//   ethics-table-talk-part1-wk*   -> PART1 scripts
//   ethics-table-talk-part2-wk*   -> PART2 scripts
// (Completed pilots and stray dev sessions are never touched.)
//
// SAFE BY DEFAULT: dry run prints stored-vs-expected title + planned char count
// per segment. Nothing is written unless you pass --apply.
//
// Run (dry run):  node server/src/scripts/importEthicsFacilitatorScripts.js
// Run (apply):    node server/src/scripts/importEthicsFacilitatorScripts.js --apply
// Requires: MONGODB_URI

